ents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-llmstxt","content":"`.../api/`"},"366":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-50","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-llmstxt","content":"If you have a large context window, fetch `llms-full.txt` instead to get\neverything in one request."},"367":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-51","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"`ops.json` contains a JSON object with an `operations` array. Each entry is a\nslim index row with the information needed to search, filter, and find the full\npayload for one operation:"},"368":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-52","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"Use this to:"},"369":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-53","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"Check if an operation is supported: filter by `\"blocked\": false`"},"370":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-54","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"Get the cost formula for a specific operation: look up by `name`"},"371":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-55","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"Get an operation's cost weight: read `weight` (the per-unit multiplier; the dtype\nrate is applied on top — see the FLOP counting model)"},"372":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-56","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"List all free operations: filter by `\"free\": true`"},"373":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-57","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"Map between NumPy and flopscope calls: use `numpy_ref` and `flopscope_ref`"},"374":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-58","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-opsjson","content":"Jump to the standalone page or full payload: use `detail_href` and `detail_json_href`"},"375":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-59","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"Each operation also has a full standalone JSON payload at:"},"376":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-60","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"For example:"},"377":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-61","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"These payloads include:"},"378":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-62","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"top-level metadata (`slug`, `detail_href`, `detail_json_href`)"},"379":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-63","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"source links (`source.flopscope`, `source.numpy`)"},"380":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-64","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"operation metadata (`op.*`)"},"381":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-65","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"normalized doc sections under `docs.sections[]`"},"382":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-66","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#how-to-use-per-op-json","content":"Fetch the per-op JSON when you need the full signature, summary, notes,\nparameter list, returns, or examples for a single function without loading the\nentire reference surface."},"383":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-67","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**1. A global default budget is active automatically — use `BudgetContext` for control.**"},"384":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-68","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"A global default budget auto-activates when flopscope is imported, so quick\nscripts work without any setup. For precise budget control and namespacing,\nuse an explicit `BudgetContext`. Both forms are valid:"},"385":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-69","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**2. Know what's free and what's counted.**"},"386":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-70","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Free (0 FLOPs): `zeros`, `ones`, `reshape`, `transpose`, `copy`,\n`random.seed`, `random.get_state`, `random.set_state`, `random.default_rng`."},"387":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-71","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Custom cost (numel FLOPs): `array`, `linspace`, `arange`, `concatenate`, `where`.\nThese are NOT free — each charges `numel(output)` FLOPs against the budget."},"388":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-72","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Counted: `einsum`, `dot`, `matmul`, `exp`, `log`, `add`, `multiply`, `sum`,\n`mean`, all `linalg.*`, all `fft.*`, `sort`, `argsort`, `trace`,\n`unique`, set ops (`in1d`, `isin`, etc.), `histogram`, `random.*` sampling."},"389":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-73","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Blocked: `geterr`, `seterr`, `savetxt`, `loadtxt`, and 27 others. These raise\n`AttributeError`. (`save`/`load`/`savez`/`savez_compressed` are supported and\npickle-free — see the Saving & Loading guide.)"},"390":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-74","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"When in doubt, check `ops.json`, the relevant `/api-data/ops/<slug>.json`, or the API Reference."},"391":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-75","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**3. Use `flops.accounting.*` to estimate costs before running.**"},"392":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-76","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"These are pure functions — no `BudgetContext` needed."},"393":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-77","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**4. Use `fnp.einsum` as the primary computation primitive.**"},"394":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-78","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Most linear algebra can be expressed as einsum. The cost follows the FMA=2\ntextbook convention — each FMA (fused multiply-add) counts as two operations.\n`'ij,jk->ik'` with shapes `(m, k)` and `(k, n)` costs `2*m*k*n − m*n` FLOPs."},"395":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-79","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**5. Use `wall_time_limit_s` for time-limited execution.**"},"396":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-80","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"In competition evaluation, submissions run under both a FLOP budget and a\nwall-clock time limit. Test locally with:"},"397":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-81","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"If the time limit is exceeded, `TimeExhaustedError` is raised at the next\noperation boundary. The error includes the operation name, elapsed time, and\nconfigured limit for diagnostics."},"398":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-82","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"**6. Exploit symmetry for cost savings.**"},"399":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-83","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Use `symmetry=` to declare a symmetric output:\n`fnp.einsum('ki,kj->ij', X, X, symmetry=(0, 1))`"},"400":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-84","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#five-rules-for-generating-flopscope-code","content":"Wrap known-symmetric matrices with `flops.as_symmetric(data, symmetry=(0, 1))`\nfor automatic savings in downstream ops"},"401":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-85","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Mistake"},"402":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-86","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"What happens"},"403":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-87","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Fix"},"404":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-88","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Using `np.einsum` instead of `fnp.einsum`"},"405":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-89","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"FLOPs not counted, budget not checked"},"406":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-90","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Always use `fnp.*` for counted NumPy-like operations"},"407":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-91","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Skipping `BudgetContext` entirely"},"408":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-92","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"No error (global default handles it), but budget is harder to track and namespace"},"409":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-93","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Use an explicit `BudgetContext` for any work you want to measure or label"},"410":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-94","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Assuming `array`, `linspace`, `concatenate`, `where` are free"},"411":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-95","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"Underestimates budget usage — each charges `numel(output)` FLOPs"},"412":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-96","page_id":"/docs/api/for-agents","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/for-agents#common-mistakes-agents-make","content":"These are custom-cost ops, not free; check the cheat sheet"},"413":{"id":"/docs/api/for-agents-97","page_id