":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"`eye`, `identity`"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-556","page_id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"diagonal length written (`max(0, min(N, M−k))` for `k≥0`, `max(0, min(N+k, M))` for `k<0`)"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-557","page_id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"DECLARED: only the diagonal 1s are written; the off-diagonal zero background is free, same as `zeros`"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-558","page_id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"`_array_ops.py`"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-559","page_id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"`tri`"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-560","page_id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"`numel(output)`"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-561","page_id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model#generator-linspace-arange-and-kin","content":"DECLARED: bills the full output (unlike `eye`, the zero region above the diagonal is not billed separately as free)"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/understanding/flop-counting-model-562","page_id":"/docs/understanding/fl